 * The accounts table, reachable only from inside this package.
 *
 * <p>Extends the bare {@link Repository} marker and declares the one method this slice has
 * a caller for, rather than {@code JpaRepository} and its forty inherited ones. Spring
 * Data implements what is declared and nothing else, so {@code deleteAll} is not a thing
 * an accounts balance can be reached by — and the interface stays a list of what the slice
 * actually does. Ticket 10 adds the query that lists accounts and ticket 12 the one that
 * locks them, each against a call site rather than ahead of one.
 */
